Quests of Thork Hellscream First
    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to Thork
        (Distance between (Position of Thork) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 500.00
        (Remaining time for DialogOverTimer) Equal to 0.00
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        -------- ======== CINEMATIC STARTS ======== --------
        Trigger - Run Cinematic ON <gen> (checking conditions)
        -------- Camera --------
        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
        Camera - Apply ThorkCamera1 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
        Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to (Position of Thork) over 1.00 seconds
        Wait 1.00 seconds
        Unit - Make Thork face Nazgrek over 0.75 seconds
        Unit - Make Nazgrek face Thork over 0.75 seconds
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (QuestCallOfTheHorde is completed) Equal to False
                (QuestCallOfTheHorde is discovered) Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Thork named Thork Hellscream: Play Thork_0010 <gen> and display So, you've arrived.....  Modify duration: Set to 4.00 seconds and Wait
                Trigger - Run CreateThorkHellscreamDialog01 <gen> (checking conditions)
                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
                Skip remaining actions
            Else - Actions
                -------- DEFAULT CAMERA --------
                Camera - Apply ThorkCameraSkipped <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                -------- ======== CINEMATIC ENDS ======== --------
                Trigger - Run Cinematic OFF <gen> (checking conditions)
                Countdown Timer - Start DialogOverTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 6.00 seconds
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
